Now do this. Or now do that.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.700
I always felt like that was you taking a break though.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.600
Yeah. Like looking like, you know, Hey, I'm super Joe.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.040
I do what I want. It could be.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.700
Yeah. But I took it as it being like your commander.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.700
But either way in this note, this is congrats on your first mission.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:56.840
It says, congratulations, heart on your first mission, on your first mission heart.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.440
Like who's writing you that letter in this war with hearts?

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.080
Yeah. War is truly beautiful.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.140
Right. Like, I mean, like you heard it here first.

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:09.440
It's funny too, because there's just like so many enemies on the screen to doing all sorts

