And I just, it begs the question of like the AI in general, like how is it programmed?

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:28.940
Like it seems so sporadic and random that I don't know if I appreciate it.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:33.560
Well, I know that at least there are some scripted parts.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:40.280
Like we're just taking a look at one of the levels right now and you'll see that there's

